              "text": "lēgātiō, lēgātiōnis — \"an embassy\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Lēgātiō ab hostibus vēnit et pācem petīvit. An embassy came from the enemy and asked for peace."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine, 3rd declension. The lēgātus (taught) led it. English legation."
            }
          ]
        },
